# Threads, interactions and field-service work
# caption: What it settles. A thread is continuity; an Interaction is one handling episode; field work hangs off a Service Request. There is no separate Booking entity, and "booked" is an outcome, never a competing schedule record. An Assist Job is a per-call work item, not a field-service job.
